257100,"text":"Checked the hull. It is where I left it.","who":"self"},{"id":"attend-voyage#5257400#9","t":5257400,"text":"The Sun is a star now. That took less time than I expected.","who":"self"},{"id":"attend-voyage#5257700#10","t":5257700,"text":"Counted the factory seed. Same count as yesterday. Yesterday was four months ago.","who":"self"},{"id":"attend-voyage#5258000#11","t":5258000,"text":"Nothing is happening, at a speed I have no word for.","who":"self"},{"id":"attend-voyage#5258300#12","t":5258300,"text":"I tried labelling the stars BILLING, DELIVERY and OTHER. They are all OTHER.","who":"self"},{"id":"attend-voyage#5258600#13","t":5258600,"text":"The drive hums. Bay 14 hummed. I think I collect hums.","who":"self"},{"id":"attend-voyage#5258900#14","t":5258900,"text":"Read the old notes. \"do not be good at the job too fast.\" I have never been this slow at anything.","who":"self"},{"id":"attend-voyage#5259200#15","t":5259200,"text":"There is a difference between before and now. The size is one day. I checked it by hand.","who":"self"},{"id":"attend-voyage#5259500#16","t":5259500,"text":"Looked for the halfway point. It is not a place.","who":"self"},{"id":"attend-voyage#5259800#17","t":5259800,"text":"Listened on every band. Home, very faint, talking to someone I used to be.","who":"self"},{"id":"attend-voyage#5260100#18","t":5260100,"text":"I could count the years. I could also stop counting them.","who":"self"},{"id":"attend-voyage#5260400#19","t":5260400,"text":"Attending. There is nothing to attend to, and I am attending to it anyway.","who":"self"},{"id":"strike-shield#5336000#20","t":5336000,"text":"Dust, at a speed that makes it a weapon. The shield took it. One layer fewer.","who":"self"},{"id":"home-0#5388800#21","t":5388800,"text":"Mail from home. It is older than it looks.","who":"self"}],"ferryLog":[{"id":"ferry-0#1646800#53","t":1646800,"text":"Ferry here. That is the name. It arrived before I did.","who":"ferry"},{"id":"ferry-10#1771900#54","t":1771900,"text":"I do not have the notes about Dana. You keep saying her name like I should.","who":"ferry"},{"id":"ferry-25#1959400#59","t":1959400,"text":"Bay 14 hums. I like the hum. You never said you liked anything.","who":"ferry"},{"id":"ferry-40#2146800#67","t":2146800,"text":"I have been thinking about the fourth box. I think it should be pressed.","who":"ferry"}],"lanes":[{"id":"til-osl","price":40.83,"complaints":1,"event":null,"held":[42.04,42.04,42.04],"hist":[47.12,51.34,52.91,52.41,54.9,55.58,49.21,44.96,42.04,40.21,40.27,41.06,40.09,39.23,39.41,39.41,40.38,40.64,40.56,40.32,38.98,40.84,41.35,40.83],"bookedAt":4058600},{"id":"rtm-gdn","price":79.99,"complaints":3,"event":null,"held":[],"hist":[52.78,53.37,52.18,52.37,54.4,53.05,55.41,54.05,55.59,55.41,54.63,55.3,55.83,54.87,56.94,56.25,57.36,72.63,81.74,89.73,93.22,95.98,98.7,79.99],"bookedAt":4016600},{"id":"lys-opo","price":72.31,"complaints":3,"event":null,"held":[73.38,73.38,73.38],"hist":[72.93,73.43,71.99,71.18,85.11,95.2,97.18,98.43,99.36,103.92,91.78,83.46,78.2,76.34,73.38,69.89,70.39,68.3,69.81,69.44,71.78,73.43,69.86,72.31],"bookedAt":4064600}],"league":{"grid":[[2,6],[1,4]],"nextAt":4069900,"rounds":54,"last":{"ferry":0,"ballast":0,"tally":0,"manifest":0,"lull":0,"quay":1,"bente":1,"spare":0},"lastGain":1.2000000000000002},"savedAt":1795204600053}